ing happens, whether it=E2=80=99s CFO, whether it=E2=80=99s a head coach or=
 anything in between.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Now, it=E2=80=99s time to put those words =
to the test. Pochettino=E2=80=99s exit is now seemingly a formality, with M=
anchester United having agreed a deal with him to replace Michael Carrick, =
who was fired on Thursday.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Who, exactly, makes sense to sustain the m=
omentum he=E2=80=99s built?</p>
